        "original_id": "1adcbc77-f23a-57b7-983c-2fa7f80f3cf2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Blake Debassige, Norval Morrisseau\n- Roles: Native Canadian artist, Aboriginal Canadian artist\n- Places: M'Chigeeng First Nation, West Bay, Manitoulin Island, Ontario\n\nFacts:\n- Norval Morrisseau was born on March 14, 1932, was also known as Copper Thunderbird, and was an Aboriginal Canadian artist.\n- Blake Debassige was born on June 22, 1956, at West Bay on Manitoulin Island in Ontario.\n- Blake Debassige is a Native Canadian artist of the M'Chigeeng First Nation.\n- Norval Morrisseau died on December 4, 2007.\n- Norval Morrisseau was appointed a Member of the Order of Canada, indicated by the post-nominal CM.",
